@startuml
!include ../_template_styles.puml
' 3V's of Big Data — Velocity, Variety, Volume
left to right direction

card "**Velocity**\n\n<size:14>Data grows very fast</size>\n<size:14>Doubling every ~2 years</size>" as V1 <<Primary>>

card "**Variety**\n\n<size:14>Structured – predefined schema</size>\n<size:14>Unstructured – documents</size>" as V2 <<Control>>

card "**Volume**\n\n<size:14>Very large (Petabytes)</size>\n<size:14>1 Peta = 1024 TB</size>" as V3 <<Task>>

V1 -> V2
V2 -> V3

@enduml
